{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09280","headline":"往富平伤怀 · 韦应物","name":"往富平伤怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晨起凌严霜，恸哭临素帷。\n驾言百里涂，恻怆复何爲。\n昨者仕公府，属城常载驰。\n出门无所忧，返室亦熙熙。\n今者掩筠扉，但闻童稚悲。\n丈夫须出入，顾尔内无依。\n衔恨已酸骨，何况苦寒时。\n单车路萧条，廻首长逶迟。\n飘风忽截野，嘹唳雁起飞。\n昔时同往路，独往今讵知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09280.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09280","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}